# proto-message: nexteggapp.taxprotos.common.v1.FormMapping
#
# What Form DR 0104 calls each concept, per tax year.
#
# Lines come from the 2025 Form DR 0104 as the Colorado Department of Revenue
# publishes it. There are no amount codes: IRS Publication 1220 covers the
# information returns the IRS receives electronically, and a state return is not
# one of them.
#
# The form prints its line numbers with a trailing full stop, as Oregon's does.

